DESCRIPTION:Anx Reader 1.14.0 | Anx-Reader-ios-1.14.0-unsigned\n\n## 1.14.0
 \n- Fix(translate): Remove legacy Microsoft reverse-engineered translation
  service and migrate saved full-text translation preference to Microsoft A
 zure API\n- Fix(l10n): Remove legacy Microsoft translation localization en
 tries\n- Feat(ai): Support separate AI reasoning content with lightweight 
 collapsible thinking UI in chat and stream views (#787)\n- Feat(reader): A
 dd background image fit mode setting with cover and stretch options\n- Fea
 t(appearance): Add setting to toggle action button labels visibility in se
 lection context menu\n- Feat(reader): Add background image blur and opacit
 y controls in reading settings (#753)\n- Feat(tts): Add Narrator option to
  text selection toolbar to start TTS from selected text (#794) Thanks @des
 kangel\n- Feat(tts): Add click to pause/resume TTS playback on currently r
 eading text (#794) Thanks @deskangel\n- Feat(tts): Add floating action but
 ton in reader for quick TTS controls (previous\, pause/resume\, next\, sto
 p) (#723)\n- Feat(reader): Add Ctrl+[ and Ctrl+] page turning shortcuts on
  macOS\, support Logitech Options+ mouse button mapping (#794) Thanks @des
 kangel\n- Feat(ai): Add global AI RPM rate limiting in AI service layer\n-
  Feat(ai): Add AI Provider Configuration Center with support for OpenAI-co
 mpatible\, Claude\, and Gemini protocols\n- Feat(ai): Support multiple API
  keys per provider with round-robin rotation\n- Feat(ai): Add provider-lev
 el reasoning_effort configuration with auto mode and advanced settings ent
 ry\n- Feat(ai): Add provider test connection with streaming preview\n- Fea
 t(ai): Add AI chat display mode settings with adaptive\, split\, and popup
  options\n- Feat(ai): Add resizable AI panel with drag to resize\, sizes p
 ersisted\n- Feat(ai): Add AI panel position settings (bottom/right) for no
 n-popup modes\n- Feat(ai): Add font size setting for AI chat via three-dot
  menu\n- Feat(ai): Add quick model switcher in AI chat input bar (tune ico
 n button)\n- Feat(ai): Add model picker in pr
